WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.340
koi ni naranai ne soba ni iru dake ja

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.340
Just being close to you doesn't make love happen.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:25.590
nazo wo kakete mo donkan na hito dakara

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:25.590
Even if I make a puzzle you can't solve it because you're slow

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.750
natsu no fuku wo kite haru no umi ni kita

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.750
We came to the spring sea, wearing summer clothes.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:40.030
anata no SHATSU de yasashiku kabatte

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:40.030
Please cover me gently with your shirt.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.840
My heart iidasenai

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.840
My heart won't let me say

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.340
Please KISU shite tte

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.340
"Please kiss me."

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.670
Day Dream

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.670
Day Dream...

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.000
yume wa fukurami

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.000
My dream gets bigger

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.150
sora ni takaku kieru

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.150
and disappears high in the sky.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:05.520
onna no ko wa dare datte shiawase ni nareru

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:05.520
Any girl can be happy.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:12.330
koi ga hajimareba kagayakidasu

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:12.330
When they fall in love, they start shining.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.970
tatoe namida nagashite mo anata no sei nara

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.970
Even if the tears start flowing, or my heart aches,

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.410
mune wo itamete mo yashiku naru

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.410
if it's because of you, she'll become gentler

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.300
Hello?

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.000
Nekomi Tech, Men's Dorm.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:33.440
Yes?

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.940
You want my senpai, Tamiya?

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.270
He's out at the moment.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.540
Yes...

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:45.050
He should be back by 6 or so.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.420
Yes...

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.690
Sure...

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.340
You're Yoshida-san, right?

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.320
I'll tell him.

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:59.650
I shouldn't have to take messages for them!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.230
Come to think of it, I haven't even had lunch yet.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:06.900
Damn!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.410
If they want me to take their messages...

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:12.810
they should at least leave me something to eat!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:15.820
Oh, well.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:16.810
I guess I'll order takeout.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.320
All right.

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:22.510
I'll settle for Shanghai fried noodles and dumplings.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.730
Hello, this is Tarafuku.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.460
I'd like to order takeout...

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.020
I'm sorry, sir.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.270
We don't make deliveries before 5 o'clock.

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.900
Oh, I see...

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:43.970
Damn.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:47.660
In that case, Fukushin's ramen lunch...

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:54.990
We're not open at this time.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:54.990
Not again!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.900
Dammit!

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:06.560
Dammit!

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:06.930
Next is...!

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.740
C'mon!

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:12.430
Answer!

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:15.810
Hello?

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:16.790
Hello.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.980
This is the Goddess Helpline.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:22.950
Oh, I'm sorry! I dialed a wrong number!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.950
I will visit you for a consultation.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:24.830
Hello!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.730
Hello...?

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.320
Hello?

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.150
Hello.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.360
Good day.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:45.590
Don't be startled...

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.720
Morisato Keiichi-san.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.550
Excuse me for not introducing myself sooner.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.860
I am Belldandy, a goddess.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:06.480
A goddess?

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:07.320
Yes.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.910
You gotta be kidding me.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:17.270
Our job is to rescue people in distress, such as yourself.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:21.370
But... I was just hungry... and trying to order takeout...

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:25.140
"Order takeout?" Is that what you desire?

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:28.250
Not only that, but anything you wish for, I can grant you.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.430
But you only get one wish.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.640
Make any wish come true?

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.120
Do you mean... really anything?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.060
Like this?

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.040
Or, this?

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:42.990
Or, even this?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.440
Stuff like that doesn't happen.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:52.670
There's no way a goddess can actually exist.

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:57.210
Besides, her coming out of the mirror must have been some kind of trick.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:02.450
I bet they made a big hole in the wall, and set something up.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.420
I get it.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:08.910
My senpai's are trying to set me up, making me think that they went out.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:14.250
They know that I can't get a girlfriend, so they're having fun at my expense!

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.210
Oh?

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.890
Why don't you have a girlfriend?

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:22.170
OK, let's stand up for a sec.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:26.760
As you can see, I'm short.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.110
Why is that the only thing keeping you from getting a girlfriend?

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:34.440
Is it such an important thing?

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.050
Is she for real?

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.510
If she is, then I'm glad.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.060
I know!

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:46.120
My wish is...

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.130
Have you decided?

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:53.260
That I want a girl like you to be with me forever!

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:01.070
But... that's a no-go, eh... now that I think about it.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:11.080
What the...?

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.840
Your wish has been approved.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.110
What?

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.500
Approved?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.390
Yes.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.080
Now, our contract is made.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.480
So, together, you and I...

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.520
"Together," you say, but this is the Men's Dorm...

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.050
It will be all right.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:55.090
When a contract is made, the so-called "Ultimate Force" starts working.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.910
"Ultimate Force?"

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.620
Yes.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:03.230
Even we goddesses cannot oppose it.

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:10.070
Even so, women are forbidden to enter this dorm.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:14.510
Anyone who breaks that rule will be kicked out, so...

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.480
I see.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:21.650
But it seems that the Ultimate Force is already working.

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:26.580
What do you mean by that?

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:29.730
Hey, Morisato!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.990
Have you been house-sitting like you were supposed to?

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.400
Well...

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:36.860
um...

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.380
I can explain...

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.930
Morisato-kun.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:45.410
Rule No. 36:

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:47.280
He who violates a Dorm Rule will be...

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.510
He who violates a Dorm Rule will be...

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.480
He who violates a Dorm Rule will be...

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:59.130
thrown out!

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:12.000
When you get a new address, we'll send your stuff to you.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:15.940
You can't be serious!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.110
This is the Ultimate Force,

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:24.210
and it starts to work whenever there's a danger that you and I may be separated.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:27.110
Am I a bother?

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.990
If a pretty girl like you is with me, I'm OK.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.190
But first...

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.790
we've got to find ourselves a place to stay.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.170
Being like this won't do us any good.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.380
Say...

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:50.710
can you do something about your clothes?

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:51.810
I mean...

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.840
aren't they a little flashy?

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:58.480
Do you think so?

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:00.580
You may be right.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.850
In that case...

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.260
How about this?

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.770
Very pretty!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.030
No, I mean...

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:20.000
How did she do that?

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.850
Well,

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.200
it should be all right.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.940
Shall we go?

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:05.950
Here you go.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.420
It's hot.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.850
Thank you.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:16.830
Um...

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.030
Yes?

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.830
Why did you come to me, of all people?

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:27.040
Aren't there a lot of people out there who want their wishes to come true?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:28.780
Yes.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:34.440
But special qualifications and an assessment are required for that to come about.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:38.040
Not everyone can receive a wish.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:41.450
Are you telling me that I have those qualifications?

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.250
Yes.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:47.680
And we're only allowed to enter into contracts with those who qualify.

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:51.330
Then, you can be with me forever?

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:52.000
Yes.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:59.730
But can a contract possibly be broken, so that you have to go back?

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.640
I don't know.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:07.710
But as long as you need me, it will be all right.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:10.950
I see.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.710
But what do we do?

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.420
We've got no place to go now.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.550
Let's go to the west.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:18.790
Is there something to the west?

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.260
There you shall find what you seek.

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:24.290
Let's go.

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:25.700
Yeah.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:32.970
Take that right, then turn left at the next corner, please.

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:33.340
OK!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.770
Turn right 50m past that,

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.070
and there will be a tobacco shop on the left hand side.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:43.480
Turn left at the next light after that, then keep going straight.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.820
Turn right at the third light,

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.250
and then left at the corner where the bookstore is.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:49.510
I'm getting confused!

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.490
Would you start from the beginning?

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:53.290
Turn right 50m past that...

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.350
That was a close call!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.910
Are you OK?

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:23.820
I'm sorry...

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:27.360
for not using my powers sooner.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.810
You don't look so good.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.860
It's raining...

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:36.970
If you keep going for about 1km, there is an old temple.

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:39.000
We must get there...

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.390
Hey!

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.030
Wait a sec!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.590
Are you asleep?

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:51.610
"An old temple?"

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:52.340
Oh!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.400
<i>That</i> temple!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.110
Here it is.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:25.060
I wonder if we should go in without asking?

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.020
What should I do?

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.190
She'll catch cold if I leave her like this!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.310
Gotta do something about those wet clothes!

00:14:58.980 --> 00:14:59.970
What the...?

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:04.310
Nothing but useless junk!

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:05.200
Oh!

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.020
All right!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:11.650
Lemme see here...

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.470
Should've known,

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:21.940
a place like this wouldn't have electricity!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.780
But I wonder why she fell asleep so suddenly?

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:45.420
Not good.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.870
I'm passing out...

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:06.810
Keiichi-san...

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:13.970
Oh no!

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.090
You have a fever!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.770
I'm sorry!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:26.210
Because of me...

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.460
Thank goodness!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:28.670
If the spirit of this place still dwells in here, you can go back...

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.400
to how beautiful you once were.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:39.770
Retrace...

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.950
and spin...

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:43.910
the thread of memory.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.780
Even if a thousand men forget...

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:48.920
the beauty that you once were...

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.850
you and I must not let it...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.920
leave our hearts.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:55.190
Cast off your withered body...

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:57.260
and be reborn!

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.090
You, who were once a beauty...

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:01.860
your Master has,

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.120
now returned!

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:34.380
You remembered.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.200
I knew you could!

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:48.940
Where am I?

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:07.860
I don't remember this temple looking this nice!

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.140
Good morning.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.350
Are you feeling better?

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.260
Yeah!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.330
Was this also done with your powers?

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:36.460
Yes.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:39.530
Is it all right for us to be here without asking?

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.240
Yes, it's all right.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:46.230
I have received permission for us to live here, as of today.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:47.870
I see.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.770
Your powers sure are amazing!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:54.180
In that case, I guess we have to go get the basic necessities.

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:57.260
Yes, we should.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.290
This should enable us to get by for the time being.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:13.590
But, boy, I sure spent a lot of money!

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:19.970
It'll be a week until I get money from my folks!

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:21.170
What'll I do?

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.710
It will be all right.

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:26.640
I'm sure that some good news will come your way soon.

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:32.550
I can feel luck swirling around you.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:34.120
Please cheer up.

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:38.380
If you say so, I'm sure it'll be all right.

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:53.000
If it's really true that I'll be living with her, just the two of us,

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.040
then that means...

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:02.680
No!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:03.650
I mustn't!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.280
She's a goddess, for crying out loud!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.520
If I do something like that, who knows what'll happen to me?

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:08.690
Keiichi-san.

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:11.790
I'll get you some tea.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.220
I'll help you with that!

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:32.780
Belldandy!

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:33.740
What can I do for you?

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:41.320
Um...

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:43.610
Who's there?

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:44.660
Oops!

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:46.290
Bad timing!

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:46.880
Megumi!

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:49.390
What're you doing here?

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.520
I can explain this!

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:01.300
Please excuse the interruption.

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:05.700
Wow, Kei-chan and a woman?

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:08.440
And to top it off, you're living with a foreigner?

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:10.740
That's pretty rad!

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:11.270
Listen, you...

00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:15.220
I'll be staying here as of today.

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:17.750
"Staying here?"

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:19.020
Who is our guest?

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:20.440
My little sister, Megumi.

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:22.860
No need to worry.

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:24.360
I get the picture.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:26.760
I won't get in your way.

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:30.960
Anyway, it'll really help me out if you let me stay here for a week or so.

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:33.470
Cause I gotta find an apartment somewhere around here.

00:22:34.110 --> 00:22:34.910
Why?

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.500
College!

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.500
College.

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:38.370
Starting in April!

00:22:38.850 --> 00:22:40.290
College?

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:41.640
Are you that old already?

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:45.480
Come on! We're only a year apart!

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:48.580
But anyways, how on Earth did you know I was here?

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:49.690
When I went to your dorm,

00:22:49.690 --> 00:22:53.320
they told me that you'd moved out so I asked for the address and found my way here.

00:22:53.920 --> 00:22:59.000
Actually, I was thinking of asking our uncle to let me stay at his place...

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.410
but this place is spacious,

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:01.420
and quiet,

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:04.030
and it'll be dangerous for me to live by myself right away,

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:06.270
so if I'm with you, I should be safe!

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:10.330
I'm not safe at all!

00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:11.570
This isn't good.

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:15.580
At this rate, I'll blow this big chance!

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:16.280
Well,

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:20.220
if I goof up, she might find out that Belldandy is a goddess!

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:22.410
Don't worry!

00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:26.490
I won't tell Mom that you two are living together.

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:27.750
What're you talkin' about?

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:29.350
This is, you see...

00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:30.320
This is what?

00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:30.780
What?

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:32.660
Hey! What?

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:35.020
You don't have to hide it from me!

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:39.170
Well, it looks like the three of us can live happily together for a while.

00:23:39.170 --> 00:23:42.480
You're so generous, it's like you're a goddess or something!

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:45.570
Cause I <i>am</i> a god-

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.950
Well, looks like that's that, and, as long as you're here, I'll take care of you.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.180
You get along well, eh?

00:23:52.180 --> 00:23:56.130
I'm Kei-chan's sister, Morisato Megumi.

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:56.890
Pleased to meet you!

00:23:57.410 --> 00:24:00.290
My name is Belldandy.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:01.120
Pleased to meet you.

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:04.150
Oh!

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:05.560
I almost forgot!

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:07.360
Here!

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:09.030
What's this?

00:24:09.660 --> 00:24:13.170
Mom gave it to me for living expenses, while I'm away from home.

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:14.470
You can have it, Kei-chan.

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:18.410
Saved!

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:20.740
Looks like we can survive for a while!

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:23.610
That's terrific, Keiichi-san.

00:24:23.610 --> 00:24:24.480
Hey!

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:25.380
Morisato!

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:28.120
We came here to celebrate your moving in!

00:24:31.150 --> 00:24:32.920
Who's this girl?

00:24:32.920 --> 00:24:33.830
Well!

00:24:33.830 --> 00:24:34.720
She's...

00:24:34.720 --> 00:24:35.580
Why, you!

00:24:35.580 --> 00:24:39.100
You've got your mitts on another girl, when you had such a cute one already?

00:24:39.100 --> 00:24:42.290
She's my sister! Honest, senpai!

00:24:42.290 --> 00:24:42.760
Oh!

00:24:42.760 --> 00:24:43.700
Why didn't you say so?

00:24:44.250 --> 00:24:48.630
If you're Kei-chan's senpai, that means that you'll be my senpai too.

00:24:48.630 --> 00:24:52.270
I'll be attending Nekomi Tech starting this Spring.

00:24:52.270 --> 00:24:54.880
I'm Morisato Keiichi's sister, Megumi!

00:24:55.300 --> 00:24:55.900
Oh!

00:24:55.900 --> 00:24:56.740
Is that so?

00:24:56.740 --> 00:25:00.350
Then you'll sign up for Auto Club, right?

00:25:00.350 --> 00:25:02.610
I'll think about it.

00:25:02.620 --> 00:25:05.290
Why, you... when you say college, do you mean Nekomi?

00:25:05.290 --> 00:25:05.850
Yeah.

00:25:10.250 --> 00:25:15.800
Well then, to celebrate Morisato-kun's moving in and Megumi-chan's starting school...

00:25:15.800 --> 00:25:18.120
let's party!

00:25:21.910 --> 00:25:25.430
Just when we had time for the two of us, alone!

00:25:25.430 --> 00:25:27.080
Hey, Morisato!

00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:29.750
Come over here and drink up!

00:25:43.040 --> 00:25:47.020
Is it all right if I join you?

00:25:47.020 --> 00:25:48.800
Sure.

00:26:43.480 --> 00:26:48.970
ude wo kunda hishochi no sanpo de

00:26:43.480 --> 00:26:48.970
Taking a stroll at a summer resort, arm in arm,

00:26:48.980 --> 00:26:54.480
guuzen deau CHAPERU no wedding

00:26:48.980 --> 00:26:54.480
we happened to come across a wedding at a chapel.

00:26:54.490 --> 00:26:59.950
asa no kaze ni tokekomu sanbika

00:26:54.490 --> 00:26:59.950
Gospels melting in the morning breeze...

00:26:59.960 --> 00:27:04.890
shiawase sou na futari

00:26:59.960 --> 00:27:04.890
A happy looking couple...

00:27:05.300 --> 00:27:07.920
omedetou! omedetou

00:27:05.300 --> 00:27:07.760
"Congratulations!"

00:27:07.770 --> 00:27:10.660
"Thank you!"

00:27:07.910 --> 00:27:10.660
arigatou! arigatou

00:27:10.670 --> 00:27:16.410
shiroi BU-KE wo sashidasu shinpu

00:27:10.670 --> 00:27:16.360
The bride tosses her white bouquet.

00:27:16.370 --> 00:27:23.000
shiawase shiawase 
 wakete ageru

00:27:16.370 --> 00:27:23.000
I will share my happiness with you.

00:27:23.010 --> 00:27:27.940
tonari de hohoemu kare

00:27:23.010 --> 00:27:27.940
The groom smiling next to her.

00:27:27.950 --> 00:27:33.210
futari noseta kuruma ga ugoku to

00:27:27.950 --> 00:27:33.210
When the car carrying the couple starts to move,

00:27:33.220 --> 00:27:38.850
anata ooki na akubi hitotsu

00:27:33.220 --> 00:27:38.850
you let out a big yawn.

00:27:38.860 --> 00:27:44.330
GYUTto ude wo tsunette ageta no

00:27:38.860 --> 00:27:44.330
I pinch your arm...

00:27:44.340 --> 00:27:50.560
omoi ni kidzuku kashira

00:27:44.340 --> 00:27:50.560
I wonder if you even realize how I feel?

00:28:11.810 --> 00:28:12.910
And now, here's the question:

00:28:13.400 --> 00:28:17.550
They live together and Keiichi still won't make a move. He's worse than a kid!

00:28:17.550 --> 00:28:21.220
To help them out, from above comes a gorgeous and smart Cupid of Love,

00:28:21.220 --> 00:28:24.020
with a personality that's loved by all.

00:28:24.170 --> 00:28:24.800
Who is she?

00:28:24.800 --> 00:28:25.570
Me!

00:28:25.570 --> 00:28:27.310
It's not your turn yet!

00:28:28.060 --> 00:28:30.260
The correct answer is in the next episode!
